    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's more than just exhaustion. It's like the story is just... done. There aren't any more pages. I look at my sword and it's the only thing that feels real anymore. It's the only thing that was with me through everything. It's almost like it's the only thing that understands why I can't go on.",
