    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's like everything has been stripped away until there's nothing but the cold and this steel. People talk about finding a new purpose, but there's no purpose in a graveyard. I look at the edge of this blade and it's the only thing that offers any kind of relief from the weight. It's almost like the only logical way to bring the silence I'm looking for.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
